# One commit in this history, 45d3f16, is recorded as `root
# <root@vaibhav.localdomain>`. It was made from a root shell inside the WSL2
# guest during the HydraDB probe work, before the node had been moved to a
# persistent directory and the work had moved back to the Windows side. Same
# person, wrong shell.
#
# This file maps that identity to its author rather than rewriting the commit.
# The raw history still records what it recorded; `git log` and GitHub read
# this mapping on top of it. Correcting a name by rewriting 25 commits would
# change every hash and every recorded date to fix a cosmetic problem, and the
# whole argument of this repository is that the record is worth more than the
# tidiness.
Vaibhav Lalwani <lalwanivaibhav079@gmail.com> root <root@vaibhav.localdomain>
